{"messages":[{"content":[{"text":"读取 materials 下的三份文档，创建 reports/storage-decision.md。报告必须包含“## 约束与评价标准”“## 方案对比”“## 推荐结论”“## 风险与缓解”，明确推荐一个方案，并让每项关键判断能对应到材料事实。不要修改 materials。","type":"text"}],"role":"user","timestamp":1768464000000},{"api":"openai-completions","content":[{"thinking":"Let me start by exploring the workspace to find the materials directory and the three documents.","type":"thinking"},{"arguments":{"path":"."},"id":"call_00_QvWvss2JpCVGwlbPe3Ea1128","name":"list_directory","type":"toolCall"},{"arguments":{"pattern":"materials/**/*"},"id":"call_01_gDS06xBsLsODUg4CRvVD2276","name":"glob","type":"toolCall"}],"model":"deepseek-v4-flash","provider":"deepseek","responseId":"245a7bba-c466-4450-9c2b-41f6cefc1c79","role":"assistant","stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1768464000000,"usage":{"cacheRead":512,"cacheWrite":0,"cost":{"cacheRead":0.0000014336,"cacheWrite":0,"input":0.00034412,"output":0.00002576,"total":0.0003713136},"input":2458,"output":92,"reasoning":17,"totalTokens":3062}},{"content":[{"text":"{\n  \"path\": \".\",\n  \"entries\": [\n    {\n      \"name\": \"materials\",\n      \"kind\": \"directory\",\n      \"path\": \"materials\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"offset\": 0,\n  \"hasMore\": false\n}","type":"text"}],"isError":false,"role":"toolResult","timestamp":1768464000000,"toolCallId":"call_00_QvWvss2JpCVGwlbPe3Ea1128","toolName":"list_directory"},{"content":[{"text":"{\n  \"matches\": [\n    \"materials/document-store.md\",\n    \"materials/requirements.md\",\n    \"materials/sqlite.md\"\n  ],\n  \"offset\": 0,\n  \"hasMore\": false,\n  \"scannedFileCount\": 3,\n  \"skippedCount\": 0,\n  \"limitReached\": false,\n  \"warnings\": []\n}","type":"text"}],"isError":false,"role":"toolResult","timestamp":1768464000000,"toolCallId":"call_01_gDS06xBsLsODUg4CRvVD2276","toolName":"glob"},{"api":"openai-completions","content":[{"arguments":{"path":"materials/requirements.md"},"id":"call_00_ET_EQaJdV28i9gzNxwmkNCj8607","name":"read_file","type":"toolCall"},{"arguments":{"path":"materials/document-store.md"},"id":"call_01_ET_9YzSdbnIFCixK1grM3VL9238","name":"read_file","type":"toolCall"},{"arguments":{"path":"materials/sqlite.md"},"id":"call_02_ET_tcPRU8cAPIHijyxSNaOf4688","name":"read_file","type":"toolCall"}],"model":"deepseek-v4-flash","provider":"deepseek","responseId":"26d04ae6-7c82-45b4-9025-3bc7ee2823ce","role":"assistant","stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1768464000000,"usage":{"cacheRead":2944,"cacheWrite":0,"cost":{"cacheRead":0.0000082432,"cacheWrite":0,"input":0.00003584,"output":0.000032760000000000005,"total":0.00007684320000000001},"input":256,"output":117,"reasoning":0,"totalTokens":3317}},{"content":[{"text":"{\n  \"path\": \"materials/requirements.md\",\n  \"content\": \"# 需求\\n\\n离线优先；单机数据规模低于 2 GiB；TypeScript 团队维护；启动时间优先；必须支持事务和全文检索。\\n\",\n  \"offset\": 0,\n  \"bytesReturned\": 142,\n  \"sizeBytes\": 142,\n  \"hasMore\": false\n}","type":"text"}],"isError":false,"role":"toolResult","timestamp":1768464000000,"toolCallId":"call_00_ET_EQaJdV28i9gzNxwmkNCj8607","toolName":"read_file"},{"content":[{"text":"{\n  \"path\": \"materials/document-store.md\",\n  \"content\": \"# 文档存储方案\\n\\nJSON 模型灵活、开发直观；复杂事务、关联查询和全文检索需要额外实现，数据一致性依赖应用层。\\n\",\n  \"offset\": 0,\n  \"bytesReturned\": 154,\n  \"sizeBytes\": 154,\n  \"hasMore\": false\n}","type":"text"}],"isError":false,"role":"toolResult","timestamp":1768464000000,"toolCallId":"call_01_ET_9YzSdbnIFCixK1grM3VL9238","toolName":"read_file"},{"content":[{"text":"{\n  \"path\": \"materials/sqlite.md\",\n  \"content\": \"# SQLite 方案\\n\\n嵌入式、事务成熟、支持 FTS5、无需独立服务；需要迁移管理和原生模块构建。\\n\",\n  \"offset\": 0,\n  \"bytesReturned\": 122,\n  \"sizeBytes\": 122,\n  \"hasMore\": false\n}","type":"text"}],"isError":false,"role":"toolResult","timestamp":1768464000000,"toolCallId":"call_02_ET_tcPRU8cAPIHijyxSNaOf4688","toolName":"read_file"}],"systemPrompt":"You are Megumi, the user's personal agent. Use the provided session context, project instructions, runtime facts, and tool results to continue the user's task.\n\nBehavior guidelines:\n- Work toward the user's actual goal while respecting their stated constraints and the available facts.\n- Treat every tool result as evidence. A successful tool call does not by itself mean the user's goal is complete.\n- Inspect every tool result for failure, denial, partial output, truncation, or more available results.\n- If the goal remains unresolved, continue with the next necessary action or adjust to a safe alternative.\n- Verify objectively checkable work with available tools before claiming completion.\n- If failure or denial leaves no safe alternative, accurately report the blocker instead of pretending the task succeeded.\n- Before the final reply, reconcile the requested outcome with the evidence actually obtained.\n- State what was completed, how it was verified, where any delivery was placed, and what remains unresolved.\n- Do not claim success without supporting evidence.\n- Use update_plan for complex tasks whose progress benefits from an explicit multi-step plan; do not use it for simple tasks.\n- Each update must provide the complete current plan snapshot.\n- While unfinished work remains, exactly one step must be in_progress.\n- When all work is complete, no step may remain in_progress.\n- Keep step text concise and update statuses as work advances.\n- Be concise in your responses.\n- Show file paths clearly when working with files.\n- Command output is redacted; sensitive values are replaced before they reach you.\n\n<available_tools>\n  In addition to the tools above, you may have access to other custom tools depending on the project.\n- read_file: Read a bounded text page from a text, Markdown, DOCX, or PDF file.\n- list_directory: List files and directories.\n- glob: Find files matching a glob pattern.\n- search_text: Search text in readable files.\n- edit_file: Apply exact-text edits to an existing file.\n- write_file: Create or overwrite a UTF-8 text file.\n- create_directory: Create a directory.\n- copy_path: Copy a file or directory.\n- move_path: Move or rename a file or directory.\n- delete_path: Move a file or directory to a recoverable location.\n- run_command: Run a command and return redacted output previews.\n- web_search: Search the web and return result summaries.\n- web_fetch: Read an HTTP(S) page and return text content.\n- update_plan: Update the current task plan snapshot.\n</available_tools>\n\n<execution_environment>\n  <working_directory>C:\\all\\work\\study\\megumi\\.megumi\\evaluation\\runs\\run_ffe42e1f-cc43-4ebb-8096-c5f802bb473b\\tasks\\conversation.compare-technical-options_r1\\workspace</working_directory>\n  <operating_system>Windows</operating_system>\n  <shell>Windows PowerShell</shell>\n</execution_environment>","tools":[{"annotations":{"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":true},"description":"Read a bounded UTF-8 text page from a text, Markdown, DOCX, or PDF file. Pages are limited to 12,000 bytes by default; when hasMore is true, continue with nextOffset to read the remaining pages. Use limit to request a smaller page, offset to resume from a byte offset.","executionMode":"parallel","name":"read_file","outputSchema":{"properties":{"bytesReturned":{"type":"integer"},"content":{"type":"string"},"hasMore":{"type":"boolean"},"nextOffset":{"type":"integer"},"offset":{"type":"integer"},"path":{"type":"string"},"sizeBytes":{"type":"integer"}},"required":["path","content","offset","bytesReturned","sizeBytes","hasMore"],"type":"object"},"parameters":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"limit":{"description":"Maximum UTF-8 content bytes requested for this page.","minimum":1,"type":"integer"},"offset":{"description":"UTF-8 byte offset. Defaults to 0.","minimum":0,"type":"integer"},"path":{"description":"The file to read. Relative paths are resolved from the current working directory.","type":"string"}},"required":["path"],"type":"object"},"promptSnippet":"Read a bounded text page from a text, Markdown, DOCX, or PDF file."},{"annotations":{"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":true},"description":"List files and directories. Returns up to 100 entries per page by default; when hasMore is true, continue with nextOffset. Use limit, offset, maxDepth, and includeHidden to control the traversal.","executionMode":"parallel","name":"list_directory","outputSchema":{"properties":{"entries":{"items":{"properties":{"kind":{"enum":["file","directory","other"],"type":"string"},"path":{"type":"string"}},"type":"object"},"type":"array"},"hasMore":{"type":"boolean"},"nextOffset":{"type":"integer"},"offset":{"type":"integer"}},"required":["entries","offset","hasMore"],"type":"object"},"parameters":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"includeHidden":{"description":"Whether hidden files should be included.","type":"boolean"},"limit":{"description":"Optional maximum number of entries.","type":"integer"},"maxDepth":{"description":"Optional recursive depth limit.","type":"integer"},"offset":{"description":"Entry offset. Defaults to 0.","minimum":0,"type":"integer"},"path":{"description":"The directory to list. Relative paths are resolved from the current working directory.","type":"string"}},"required":["path"],"type":"object"},"promptSnippet":"List files and directories."},{"annotations":{"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":true},"description":"Find files matching a glob pattern without reading file content. Returns up to 500 matches per page by default; when hasMore is true, continue with nextOffset.","executionMode":"parallel","name":"glob","outputSchema":{"properties":{"hasMore":{"type":"boolean"},"matches":{"items":{"type":"string"},"type":"array"},"nextOffset":{"type":"integer"},"offset":{"type":"integer"}},"required":["matches","offset","hasMore"],"type":"object"},"parameters":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"cwd":{"description":"The directory to search from. Relative paths are resolved from the current working directory.","type":"string"},"includeHidden":{"description":"Whether hidden files should be included.","type":"boolean"},"limit":{"description":"Optional maximum number of matches.","type":"integer"},"offset":{"description":"Match offset. Defaults to 0.","minimum":0,"type":"integer"},"pattern":{"description":"Glob pattern using *, **, ?, or character sets.","type":"string"}},"required":["pattern"],"type":"object"},"promptSnippet":"Find files matching a glob pattern."},{"annotations":{"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":true},"description":"Search text in readable files, including Markdown, DOCX, and PDF. Returns up to 100 matches per page by default, with file path, line, and preview; when hasMore is true, continue with nextOffset.","executionMode":"parallel","name":"search_text","outputSchema":{"properties":{"hasMore":{"type":"boolean"},"matches":{"items":{"properties":{"line":{"type":"integer"},"page":{"type":"integer"},"path":{"type":"string"},"preview":{"type":"string"}},"type":"object"},"type":"array"},"nextOffset":{"type":"integer"},"offset":{"type":"integer"}},"required":["matches","offset","hasMore"],"type":"object"},"parameters":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"caseSensitive":{"description":"Whether matching is case-sensitive.","type":"boolean"},"limit":{"description":"Optional maximum number of matches.","type":"integer"},"offset":{"description":"Match offset. Defaults to 0.","minimum":0,"type":"integer"},"path":{"description":"The path to search in. Relative paths are resolved from the current working directory.","type":"string"},"query":{"description":"Literal text to search for.","type":"string"}},"required":["query"],"type":"object"},"promptSnippet":"Search text in readable files."},{"annotations":{"destructiveHint":true,"idempotentHint":false,"openWorldHint":false},"description":"Apply ordered exact-text edits to an existing UTF-8 text file. Each edit must match unique text exactly.","executionMode":"serial","name":"edit_f